6085,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>dificultless</span>"},{"id":6086,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>less difficult than</span>"}]},{"id":4206,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>This exam was _____ the last one.</div>","choices":[{"id":6081,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>more easy</span>"},{"id":6082,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>easier than</span>"},{"id":6083,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>more easier than</span>"}]},{"id":4208,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Robert is _____ than his opponent.</div>","choices":[{"id":6087,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>very stronger</span>"},{"id":6088,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>much strong</span>"},{"id":6089,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>much stronger</span>"}]},{"id":4209,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Kevin is funny, but George is ____.</div>","choices":[{"id":6090,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>more funny than</span>"},{"id":6091,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>funnier</span>"},{"id":6092,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>funnier than</span>"}]},{"id":4210,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Your house is far, but my house is _____.</div>","choices":[{"id":6093,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>more far</span>"},{"id":6094,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>farer</span>"},{"id":6095,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>further</span>"}]},{"id":4211,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Kate is _____ than her sister. </div>","choices":[{"id":6096,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>friendly </span>"},{"id":6097,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>friendlier</span>"},{"id":6098,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>more friendlier</span>"}]},{"id":4212,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Everybody hates him. He really thinks that women are _____ men.</div>","choices":[{"id":6099,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>intelligentless than</span>"},{"id":6100,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>less intelligent that</span>"},{"id":6101,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>less intelligent than</span>"}]}]},{"id":482,"questions":[{"id":4213,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I like the black sofa, but I think the brown sofa is <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (comfortable).</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4214,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>This bar is <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (noisy) the bars in my street. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4215,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Marseille is much <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (hot) Paris. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4216,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The helicopter was loud, but the ambulance was <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (loud). </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4217,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Do you think Manchester United is <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (good) Manchester City this year?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4218,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The novel is much <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (interesting) the film.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4219,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Canadians are <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (rich) in the past. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4220,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>This summer was <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (wet) last summer. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4221,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I liked the old version of the game, but the new version is much <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (exciting).</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4222,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Sorry, 8 o'clock is very late. Can we meet a bit <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (early)? </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}